Hi Patrio Gabriel,

Three things quietly cut your per-token cost on OpenRouter. They stack, and=
 none of them require changing models or rewriting your app.

Compare model pricing ( https://openrouter.ai/models?utm_source=3Demail&utm=
_medium=3Dlifecycle&utm_campaign=3Donboarding_v2&utm_content=3Da10_pricing&=
utm_campaign=3DOnboarding+Flow+-+v4+April+2026&utm_content=3DA8+Pricing+Tie=
rs&utm_medium=3Demail_action&utm_source=3Dcustomer.io )

=E2=80=83

1. TIERED PRICING

Most models run on tiered pricing set by the provider: the more tokens you =
send through, the less each token costs. You do not opt in. The discount ap=
plies automatically once you cross the threshold. Open any model page on op=
enrouter.ai/models ( https://openrouter.ai/models?utm_campaign=3DOnboarding=
+Flow+-+v4+April+2026&utm_content=3DA8+Pricing+Tiers&utm_medium=3Demail_act=
ion&utm_source=3Dcustomer.io ) and click the Effective Pricing tab to see t=
he live per-provider rate, including any tiers you have already hit. Consol=
idating traffic onto one or two models unlocks the next tier faster than sc=
attering tokens across five.

2. PROVIDER PREFERENCES

The same model is served by multiple providers at different rates. provider=
 in the request body lets you prefer cheaper providers, sort by price, or s=
et a price ceiling. It is a per-request setting, so you can apply it select=
ively to traffic where latency matters less than cost. Docs: Provider Routi=
ng ( https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/provider-routing?utm_campaign=3DOn=
boarding+Flow+-+v4+April+2026&utm_content=3DA8+Pricing+Tiers&utm_medium=3De=
mail_action&utm_source=3Dcustomer.io ).

3. PROMPT CACHING

On supported models, OpenRouter reuses cached prompt prefixes across reques=
ts, so repeated context costs a fraction of the first call. Useful for long=
 system prompts, RAG, agents that replay history, and anything that ships t=
he same context every turn. Per-request, no extra wiring. Docs: Prompt Cach=
ing ( https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/prompt-caching?utm_campaign=3DOnb=
oarding+Flow+-+v4+April+2026&utm_content=3DA8+Pricing+Tiers&utm_medium=3Dem=
ail_action&utm_source=3Dcustomer.io ).

