    <p style=3D"color: #71717a; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: =
0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">1. TIERED PR=
ICING</p>

   =20
 =20
  <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;">Most models run on tiered pricing set by the=
 provider: the more tokens you send through, the less each token costs. You=
 do not opt in. The discount applies automatically once you cross the thres=
hold. Open any model page on <a href=3D"https://email-v3.openrouter.ai/e/c/=
eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU0VfUW9CQUlLdW13U0JycHNFQVo3MHlYX3k3b2Y1ZkVQcWN2eW1Ldz0=
9IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vb3BlbnJvdXRlci5haS9tb2RlbHM_dXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPU9uYm=
9hcmRpbmcrRmxvdystK3Y0K0FwcmlsKzIwMjZcdTAwMjZ1dG1fY29udGVudD1BOCtQcmljaW5nK=
1RpZXJzXHUwMDI2dXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbF9hY3Rpb25cdTAwMjZ1dG1fc291cmNlPWN1c3Rv=
bWVyLmlvIiwiaW50ZXJuYWwiOiI4NGZkMGFhNjAyZTE4MzAxODJhZTliMDQiLCJsaW5rX2lkIjo=
2fQ/80181dfa3507a513fdee39619d4cb02adfe4e9e46210b2e148b01ca1f20d901b" style=
=3D"color: #6367f0;
font-weight: 500;
text-decoration: underline" class=3D"inline-link">openrouter.ai/models</a> =
and click the Effective Pricing tab to see the live per-provider rate, incl=
uding any tiers you have already hit. Consolidating traffic onto one or two=
 models unlocks the next tier faster than scattering tokens across five.</p=
>
 =20

    <p style=3D"color: #71717a; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: =
0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">2. PROVIDER =
PREFERENCES</p>

   =20
 =20
  <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;">The same model is served by multiple provide=
rs at different rates. <code style=3D"background: #f4f4f5; color: #111827; =
padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', =
'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px;" class=3D"or-inline-code">provid=
er</code> in the request body lets you prefer cheaper providers, sort by pr=
ice, or set a price ceiling. It is a per-request setting, so you can apply =
it selectively to traffic where latency matters less than cost. Docs: <a hr=
ef=3D"https://email-v3.openrouter.ai/e/c/eyJlbWFpbF9pZCI6ImRnU0VfUW9CQUlLdW=
13U0JycHNFQVo3MHlYX3k3b2Y1ZkVQcWN2eW1Ldz09IiwiaHJlZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vb3BlbnJvd=
