VyLmlvIiwiaW50ZXJuYWwiOiI4NGZkMGFhNjAyZTE4MzAxODJhZTliMDQiLCJsaW5rX2lkIjo5f=
Q/3a1e47416e7b70c990ee09412b89eaf357d3c5e1c30db4c0462f6fd8a5d0ef73" style=
=3D"color: #6367f0;
font-weight: 500;
text-decoration: underline" class=3D"inline-link">Provider Routing</a>.</p>
 =20

    <p style=3D"color: #71717a; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: =
0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">3. PROMPT CA=
CHING</p>

   =20
 =20
  <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;">On supported models, OpenRouter reuses cache=
d prompt prefixes across requests, so repeated context costs a fraction of =
the first call. Useful for long system prompts, RAG, agents that replay his=
tory, and anything that ships the same context every turn. Per-request, no =
extra wiring. Docs: <a href=3D"https://email-v3.openrouter.ai/e/c/eyJlbWFpb=
F9pZCI6ImRnU0VfUW9CQUlLdW13U0JycHNFQVo3MHlYX3k3b2Y1ZkVQcWN2eW1Ldz09IiwiaHJl=
ZiI6Imh0dHBzOi8vb3BlbnJvdXRlci5haS9kb2NzL2ZlYXR1cmVzL3Byb21wdC1jYWNoaW5nP3V=
0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1PbmJvYXJkaW5nK0Zsb3crLSt2NCtBcHJpbCsyMDI2XHUwMDI2dXRtX2Nvbn=
